name verbatlas-pb2va
# pb2va.tsv: "A mapping from PropBank to VerbAtlas. Each line maps a PropBank predicate sense and its corresponding
# argument structure to a VerbAtlas frame and its argument structure as follows:
#   [PB predicate sense]>[VA frame]    [PB role]>[VA role]    ..."
# The roleset is the PropBank roleset its id names, and that it is in the frame is said of it, as the pair of the two;
# each of its roles is said of it under the role's PropBank name, as the VerbAtlas role it is ([abandon.01, A0, Agent],
# each part as the type or text it is); the highway maps the roleset to the frame. The first line is the release's
# banner.
match pb2va.tsv

tier row by \n
skip 1
names pbva r1 r2 r3 r4 r5 r6 r7
tier field by \t
part pbva by >
part r* by \t is >

thing row pbva/1
type pbva pbroleset vaframe
content r*
pair row pbva/2
attest row r*

maps row pbva/1 pbroleset to pbva/2 vaframe
